    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16461" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστεγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without roof, houseless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Phoc.
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				58.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hisp.</u>
				78
			</span></i>; <i>unprotected, exposed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.574
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγω</span>) 
				Act.
			, <i>not holding</i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. χείλεσι</span>
			<i>unable to keep</i> one's mouth <i>shut, given to prating,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				10.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα ἄ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				26.28
			</span></i>.</div>
